镇屋檐 错落的星光\n故乡啊 离别可曾改了模样\n老井旁的风筝 是否还在飞翔\n\n[Bridge]\n等到某一天 我卸下了沧桑\n穿过那片 泛着金黄的稻香\n一柱温柔柴火 一抹晚霞光\n原来漂泊再远 都有港湾归航\n\n[Final Chorus]\n故乡啊 你是我温暖的源头\n无论身在何方 梦都往回飞翔\n故乡啊 等我重踏上这片土\n再把一路风霜 对你细细讲\n\n[Outro]\n（慢慢讲……）\n(Piano fading out...)\n[End]"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [433.5034484863281, 610.9755859375], "pos": [669.6087646484375, 3130.459716796875], "id": 53, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 73, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PreviewAudio", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [270, 88], "pos": [0, 4532.5], "id": 71, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAudio"}, "order": 30}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [4276.55517578125, 259.30816650390625], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-694.0443115234375, 2383.3701171875], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 461, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#1B4669", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 111, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 3, "text": "粉丝福利：点击\"右上角自己的头像\">邀请码>填写邀请码：【jcsogz1s】送1000RH币", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#fec806"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [866], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [355.13226318359375, 82], "pos": [1504.288330078125, 4582.4248046875], "widgets_values": ["anima_baseV10.safetensors", "default"], "inputs":